---
title: "cancel (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller != projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_supplied: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_state: tokens already supplied
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert CannotCancelAfterTokenSupply
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_withdrawn: tokens not supplied
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_require_return: capital was withdrawn (must return)
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_set_canceled: capital not withdrawn
    q_require_return --> q_return_capital: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalCapitalRaised + fees)
    q_return_capital --> q_set_canceled: capital returned
    q_set_canceled --> [*]: isCanceled = true, emit SaleCanceled

    note right of q_check_withdrawn
        INV-001: if capital was withdrawn, project must return it with fees
        INV-002: cancellation only before token supply
    end note

    note right of q_require_return
        INV-003: returned amount must cover all investor refunds
        INV-004: fee amounts must also be returned
    end note
